#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:639
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"We assembled the selected REA-returned Java methods in a small test program."
" Their output matched an independent reconstruction on {ph0}133 test "
